&lt;p style="margin-left: 48px; line-height: 16px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 48px; line-height: 16px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 12px"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 48px; line-height: 16px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 12px"&gt;(ⅱ) （在任期間係数）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style="margin-left: 48px"&gt;
